<title>UK: B.A.T recovers as BZW repeats &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>B.A.T recovers as BZW repeats &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>B.A.T Industries Plc shares firmed on Thursday as analysts at BZW repeated a &quot;buy&quot; recommendation and set a target price of between 650p and 700p, dealers said.</p>
<p>Bouncing from Wednesday's 20-1/2p drop after the tobacco and insurance conglomerate's surprise decision not to raise its first-half dividend, the stock was up 4p at 523-1/2 by 1001 GMT, in slim volume of 1.3 million shares.</p>
<p>Analysts at BZW could not immediately be reached for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
